lse,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-22T03:38:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T14:42:31Z","closed_at":"2026-09-02T14:42:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.7.beta [ef02314], 4.6.1.stable, 4.6.stable, 4.5.1.stable.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9636) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.69 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nNoticed this when working on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119617.\n\nRelated: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119593\n\nYellow foreign nodes (editable children, inherited scene child nodes) are not supposed to be rename-able (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115572#issuecomment-3817503816). However, in some edge cases, both \"Rename\" and \"Batch Rename\" are available in the scene tree context menu, and both can rename foreign nodes without triggering the \"Alert!\" pop-up.\n\nI can open a PR if needed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP, or set it up manually:\n1a. Create a main scene.\n1b. Add a scene instance of a normal scene.\n1c. Add a scene instance of an inherited scene.\n1d. Enable \"editable children\" on (1b) and (1c).\n2. Hold `Shift` to select the nodes between the normal scene's instance and the inherited scene's instance.\n3. Press F2, or right-click to open the context menu to select (batch) rename.\n4. See that the yellow nodes are renamed without the \"Alert!\" pop-up.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93607bc8-09fa-4586-b3df-d1c343d00c4f\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_Batch_Rename_Foreign.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28132344/MRP_Batch_Rename_Foreign.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119645/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119645/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}